---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Ruhani Creations by Sumati"
  description="Ruhani Creations by Sumati is a design-led creative studio from Agra for occasion wear, hand-painted accents, curated bags, gifting, and wearable art."
>
  <main class="content-main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy-block">
          <p class="eyebrow">Design-led clothing, hand-painted accents, curated bags, and studio-crafted gifting.</p>
          <h1 class="hero-title">A creative design studio for clothing, keepsakes, and handcrafted everyday beauty.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">
            Ruhani Creations by Sumati brings together women’s occasion wear, girl child festive sets, hand-painted dupatta stories, and emerging bag lines shaped by artistry, softness, and thoughtful detail from our Agra studio.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="/catalog">Explore Catalog</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="/how-to-order">How to Order</a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/contact">Visit the Studio</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-panel brand-storyboard" aria-label="Studio snapshot">
          <article class="storyboard-primary">
            <div class="storyboard-logo-frame">
              <img class="storyboard-logo" src="/assets/RCBS_Logo_dark.PNG" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati logo">
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="showcase-tag">Creative Direction</span>
              <h2 class="showcase-title">Catalog-first, studio-guided.</h2>
              <p class="showcase-note">The catalog helps customers discover pieces and references. The order flow and studio conversation take care of availability, sizing, gifting notes, and final confirmation.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <div class="storyboard-grid">
            <article class="storyboard-note">
              <span class="showcase-tag">What We Create</span>
              <h2 class="showcase-title">Occasion wear with handcrafted detailing</h2>
              <p class="showcase-note">Women’s wear, girl child festive sets, dupatta edits, and celebration-led silhouettes shaped with a painter’s sensitivity.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="storyboard-note">
              <span class="showcase-tag">What’s Expanding</span>
              <h2 class="showcase-title">Utility pieces with the same design language</h2>
              <p class="showcase-note">Tote bags, sets of three, yoga mat carry bags, and gifting-led products are becoming part of the studio’s next chapter.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="storyboard-note">
              <span class="showcase-tag">How It Works</span>
              <h2 class="showcase-title">Reference archive plus ready-to-order pieces</h2>
              <p class="showcase-note">Some sold items stay visible for inspiration, while available items move directly into WhatsApp, email, or Instagram handoff.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="storyboard-note">
              <span class="showcase-tag">From Agra</span>
              <h2 class="showcase-title">Founder-led support from the studio</h2>
              <p class="showcase-note">Each order conversation is guided with practical help on styling, occasion fit, availability, and studio scheduling.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container home-bands">
      <section class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">What We Offer</p>
            <h2>Design categories that move from wearables to functional keepsakes.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="collection-grid">
          <article class="collection-card collection-card-text">
            <span class="collection-emblem">WW</span>
            <h3>Women’s Wear</h3>
            <p>Sarees, suit and dupatta sets, lehengas, and event-ready silhouettes designed for polished celebrations and studio-guided styling.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="collection-card collection-card-text">
            <span class="collection-emblem">GC</span>
            <h3>Girl Child Festive Wear</h3>
            <p>Traditional sets, lehengas, and playful celebration looks created to stay comfortable while still photographing beautifully.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="collection-card collection-card-text">
            <span class="collection-emblem">PA</span>
            <h3>Hand-painted Accents</h3>
            <p>Dupatta stories, painted motifs, and signature art-led detailing that help every piece feel personal and one of one.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="collection-card collection-card-text">
            <span class="collection-emblem">BU</span>
            <h3>Creative Bags &amp; Utility Pieces</h3>
            <p>Tote bags with zipper, tote bags without zipper, sets of three bags, and yoga mat carry bags are part of the studio’s expanding design line.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">How We Work</p>
            <h2>A simpler path from browsing to a real order conversation.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-grid">
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">01</div>
            <h3>Browse and shortlist</h3>
            <p>Start with the catalog, review the images, and note the product codes for the pieces that fit your occasion or gifting need.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">02</div>
            <h3>Use the built-in order flow</h3>
            <p>Available products now include an Order button that opens WhatsApp, email, or Instagram with the product details already prepared.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-number">03</div>
            <h3>Confirm with the studio</h3>
            <p>Once details are aligned, we guide you on sizing, availability, pickup or delivery, and the next step toward confirmation.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-shell split-panel">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Founder-led Craft</p>
          <h2>Created by Sumati Aswani with hand-painting, design sensitivity, and meaningful detail at the core.</h2>
          <p class="info-copy">
            Every collection is shaped by Sumati’s artistic eye: softness in colour, intention in detail, and a preference for pieces that feel intimate rather than generic or mass-made.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button ghost" href="/about#founder">Read the founder story</a>
            <a class="button ghost" href="/about#brand">Explore the brand philosophy</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="brand-mark-card">
          <img class="page-mark" src="/assets/RCBS_Logo_dark.PNG" alt="Ruhani Creations by Sumati logo">
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section-shell">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Visit, Review, or Reach Us</p>
            <h2>From our Agra studio to your next celebration, order, or keepsake idea.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-grid">
          <article class="detail-card">
            <h3>Studio location</h3>
            <p>B27, Sarlabagh Extension, DayalBagh, Agra, Uttar Pradesh 282005</p>
            <div class="contact-links">
              <a class="button ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Ruhani%20Creations%20by%20Sumati%2C%20B27%2C%20Sarlabagh%20Extension%2C%20DayalBagh%2C%20Agra%2C%20Uttar%20Pradesh%20282005" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open in Google Maps</a>
              <a class="button ghost" href="/contact">View timings and channels</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="detail-card">
            <h3>Best ways to connect</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>WhatsApp for orders and appointments: <a href="https://wa.me/919105114152" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">+91 91051 14152</a></li>
              <li>Instagram for latest updates: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ruhani.creations/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@ruhani.creations</a></li>
              <li>Google Business listing: Ruhani Creations by Sumati</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>